idea_1 = Consider if this is a recurring issue or if it's specific to certain situations, then decide on whether to communicate openly with your husband about how his behavior is affecting you, or to take more personal time for yourself to reflect and recharge; 
idea_2 = If communication doesn't resolve the issue, consider seeking advice from a trusted friend or family member, or potentially from a professional therapist;
idea_3 = As a last resort, if all else fails and your well-being continues to be negatively impacted, you might weigh the benefits and drawbacks of deciding to separate or move out.
